<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia's Sunway 6-mth net up 53.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia's Sunway 6-mth net up 53.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to June 30</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit		15.03	vs	  9.79</p>
<p>    Shr	 (cents)     24.41	vs	 15.90</p>
<p>    Turnover		 180.90	vs	117.67</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  20.14	vs	 12.27</p>
<p>    Minorities	less   0.58	vs  less  0.34</p>
<p>    Dividend  (cents)	4.0	 vs	  nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Sunway Building Technology Bhd. It makes readymixed concrete and concrete products.</p>
<p>- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 230 8911)</p>
</text>
